`benchmark.meta description: Updates and paints a modest multi-frame shape field into CountingCanvas.
`benchmark.meta timing: recommended
`benchmark.meta profiles: graphics,compile-timing

/graphics/canvas
/graphics/color
/graphics/graphic
/graphics/path
/graphics/point
/graphics/shapes
/graphics/style
/graphics/vector-group

. canvas = CountingCanvas(480, 360)
canvas.fill-color = red
canvas.stroke-color = blue
canvas.stroke-width = 1

. checksum = 0 as Size
for frame in 0 .. < 120
    . paths [Path]
    for i in 0 .. < 72
        . f = i as Float
        . x = 20 + ((f * 11 + frame) % 260)
        . y = 20 + ((f * 7 + frame * 2) % 180)
        paths += circle((x, y), 5 + (f % 8))
        paths += rectangle((x + 8, y + 4, 8 + (f % 5), 6 + (f % 7)))

    . group = VectorGroup(paths)
    group.fill = red
    group.stroke = blue
    group.checkpoint()
    group.paint-vector(canvas)
    checksum += canvas.path-count + paths.length + frame

checksum += canvas.checksum + canvas.path-segment-count
-- "bench-result graphics/frame-shape-field-counting checksum=$checksum"
